        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sara Carbonero, Iker Casillas\n- Roles: sports journalist, TV presenter, goalkeeper\n- Organizations: Telecinco, Futebol Clube do Porto\n- Places: Spain, Oporto, Portugal\n- Concepts: nickname, shot-stopping, quick reactions\n\nFacts:\n- Sara Carbonero Arévalo was born on 3 February 1984.\n- Sara Carbonero Arévalo is a Spanish sports journalist.\n- Since early 2000, Sara Carbonero was a TV presenter for Telecinco.\n- In July 2015, Sara Carbonero moved to Oporto in Portugal when her husband Iker Casillas joined Futebol Clube do Porto.\n- Iker Casillas is nicknamed \"San Iker\" (\"Saint Iker\") for his ability to produce spectacular saves.\n- Iker Casillas is an athletic goalkeeper known for quick reactions and outstanding shot-stopping ability.",
